  regression test plan for wrapped
  suggestions and multiline drafts.

● Terminal width matters because it
  determines where text soft-wraps, so a
  suggestion or multiline draft that
  fits on one line at one width splits
  across several rows at another,
  changing how the composer's content is
  rendered, read back, and detected as
  empty or non-empty.

  Ready for the regression test plan
  whenever you are.

